Private access is PAUSED.

The password screen is not removed: access.on, gate.html and the gate logic in
server.mjs are all still here and will be used again later. This file only
pauses the gate, so visitors can open www.sargara.com directly.

Lock the site again by deleting this file and redeploying:

    rm access.off

Do not delete access.on — it is what keeps the gate armed for next time.
